# Regenerable state of an M1 run: everything here comes back from `spec.json` + the seed, so it is
# not committed. The evidence IS committed: manifest.json (the trace sha256), spec.json (the
# parameters, batch and on_hand), windows-<arm>.jsonl, run-<arm>.json and scoreboard.{md,json}.
trace.jsonl
seed.jsonl
instance-*/
probe-*.jsonl
probe-*.log
driver-*.log
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
